---
import LocationLayout from '../layouts/LocationLayout.astro';
import { locationsBySlug } from '../data/locations';

const location = locationsBySlug['columbia'];
---

<LocationLayout 
  location={location}
  title="Personal Injury Lawyer in Columbia | Alex Poberesky Law"
  description="Experienced personal injury and criminal defense attorney serving Columbia, Maryland. Free consultation. Call (410) 484-0400."
>
  <h2>Dedicated Legal Representation for Columbia Residents</h2>
  
  <p>
    Columbia, Maryland's second-largest city and one of the nation's most successful planned 
    communities, offers residents an exceptional quality of life. But accidents and legal 
    challenges can happen anywhere. Attorney Alex Poberesky provides experienced personal 
    injury and criminal defense representation to Columbia residents from our Pikesville office, 
    just 20 minutes away via I-695 and I-70.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Personal Injury Cases in Columbia</h3>
  
  <p>
    Columbia's busy road network, including Routes 29, 175, and 108, serves tens of thousands 
    of commuters daily. The Mall in Columbia and numerous village centers attract heavy traffic. 
    When accidents happen on these roads or in Columbia's many businesses and facilities, 
    victims need experienced representation to recover fair compensation.
  </p>
  
  <p>We handle all types of personal injury cases in Columbia, including:</p>
  
  <ul>
    <li>Car accidents on Routes 29, 175, 108, and local roads</li>
    <li>Pedestrian accidents at village centers and the Mall</li>
    <li>Bicycle accidents on Columbia's pathway system</li>
    <li>Slip and fall accidents at businesses and common areas</li>
    <li>Medical malpractice at Howard County General Hospital and local practices</li>
    <li>Pool and recreational facility accidents</li>
    <li>Workplace injuries</li>
    <li>Wrongful death cases</li>
  </ul>
  
  <h3>Criminal Defense for Columbia Residents</h3>
  
  <p>
    Criminal charges can threaten your career, your security clearance, and your future. 
    Many Columbia residents work in positions requiring background checks and security 
    clearances. We provide experienced, discreet defense for clients facing DUI charges, 
    drug offenses, assault, theft, and other criminal matters.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Understanding Columbia's Unique Needs</h3>
  
  <p>
    Columbia residents often hold professional positions with significant responsibilities. 
    We understand the importance of resolving legal matters efficiently and discretely. 
    Our 26+ years of experience means we can navigate your case effectively while minimizing 
    disruption to your life and career.
  </p>
  
  <h3>Serving All Columbia Villages and Howard County</h3>
  
  <p>
    We represent clients throughout Columbia's ten villages—Wilde Lake, Harper's Choice, 
    Oakland Mills, Long Reach, Owen Brown, Hickory Ridge, Dorsey's Search, King's Contrivance, 
    River Hill, and Town Center—as well as nearby communities like Ellicott City, Elkridge, 
    and throughout Howard County. Contact us today for a free consultation.
  </p>
</LocationLayout>
